// January 2026. The folder already says 2026 and the file says January, so a
// line's date is its day. The book starts here: what Sam holds on the first,
// then the month. A line naming a contract is that contract kept once.
//
// How a line says why:
//   #purpose   structured: declared, typed, budgeted, counted by the tax laws
//   "text"     a description, free: no declaration, no meaning beyond itself
//   ^code      a link: the same code on an invoice and on its payment

